On Wednesday, January 30, 2013 2:41:05 AM UTC+4, Feilen Haksan wrote:
>
> Well... Ideally you two should figure it out directly before I put any 
> continuous effort into either project.
>

Look here http://mw.lojban.org/index.php/jbobau_selci%27a/en

See that message "This article contains links to articles from the 
lojban.org Tiki Wiki. If possible, please add up-to-date articles to this 
Wiki to replace the external links." ?

So if you have time it'd be best to copy the text of those translated texts 
from external sources to the wiki.


Another primary goal for a lojbanist that has free time would be to write a 
new textbook for beginners, e.g. base on existing one (the Waves, L4B, 
CLL). Yes, I know, there is no direct connection with the wiki. Still, if 
you have free time... :)

